+The first GREEN attempt was 17 pass / 1 fail / 58 assertions ([log](m8-01/green-initial.log)): the cancellation test incorrectly assumed Effect 4's `Fiber.interrupt` returns an Exit. Installed declaration and existing test usage showed it returns void. Only the test was corrected to await `Fiber.await`; subsequent [GREEN](m8-01/green.log) was 18 pass / 0 fail / 65 assertions. Four additional cleanup cases required no production changes. Scoped lint initially reported three own warnings ([log](m8-01/lint-initial.log)); explicit `undefined` returns and removal of unnecessary assertions resolved them. Final verification reflects those changes.
